# ── Notes ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HOW IT WORKS:
#   app/build.gradle.kts reads this file at build time using loadEnv().
#   CHATBOT_BASE_URL and CHATBOT_API_KEY are injected as BuildConfig fields
#   and accessed in Java code as BuildConfig.CHATBOT_BASE_URL / CHATBOT_API_KEY.
#   Firebase SDK is configured separately via app/google-services.json.
